rockingham-county"],["ARC or PLC in Rockingham County","/arc-plc/new-hampshire/rockingham-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. On the middle, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle got 55% of normal for July to August and 59% for June to July. Grid 27235 had its driest year in 1965 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
